OL,3,GNEWSAThieves strip vineyard of 500kg of
OL,4,Agrapes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vineyard owner has said it was
OL,7,F"disheartening" to discover the theft
OL,8,Fof about 500kg (1,100lb) of grapes
OL,9,Fworth about #1,000.
OL,11,FLee Dyer, from Winbirri Vineyard in
OL,12,FSurlingham, Norfolk, realised some of
OL,13,Fhis rows had been "completely stripped"
OL,14,Fwhile harvesting the crop on 28
OL,15,FSeptember.
OL,17,F"The biggest impact is that's 400
OL,18,Fbottles we now won't have," he said. He
OL,19,Fhas reported the crime to Norfolk
OL,20,FPolice.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
