OL,3,GNEWSAThieves strip vineyard of 500kg of
OL,4,Agrapes
OL,5,
OL,6,FNick Watson, who is chairman of WineGB
OL,7,FEast and runs a vineyard near
OL,8,FNewmarket, Suffolk, described the
OL,9,Fincident as "unprecedented".
